{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "おはようございます\nこんにちは\nこんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 菅原咲月（すがわらさつき）です🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10月31日に２０歳の誕生日を迎えました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mob3UpKK5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobsFdpUh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日のミーグリ\nハロウィン楽しんでました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10代ラスト仮装は何にしよう......と悩んだ結果\n思い切って、ザ・アイドル！！にしたくて一目惚れしたかわいいメイドになってみました＾＾\nかわいいーーーー？💘💘"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46のメンバーとしていられる今、幸せです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人生の節目。\nこの大切なタイミングを乃木坂46の菅原咲月として過ごせていられるのがほんっっっとうに幸せでいっぱいです！！\n最近すごく感じます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと、何か大きく変わるわけでないと思うけれど......\nより自覚と責任を持ってこれからも進んでいきます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46としても個人としても\nやりたい事、叶えたい事沢山あります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "時間はかかってもいいから、全部叶えたいね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobvru2m8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobeGvO6s.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, 